[0.002, "o", "$ curl -s -u natas28:<pw> http://natas28.natas.labs.overthewire.org/\r\n$   a joke search form. POST query -> 302 to search.php/?query=<base64 ciphertext>\r\n$   the source is not available (\"out of sauce\"), so we probe the black box.\r\n"]
